              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court further explained that the FAA does not require courts to enforce waivers of substantive rights, because the FAA\u2019s mandate is only to enforce arbitration agreements."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "04de0530b297067d10c9f63230646000a1600ff432d262c7da7ceb35cb14a89e",
